  "name": "Evolved Mobility",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your body has adapted to new forms of movement beyond its normal capabilities. During your daily preparations, select an anima spell you have prepared that lists a movement speed you do not naturally have under its anima morph property. You gain a 25-foot movement speed of that type.</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span> If you have the Shifting Mobility feat, if you select the same anima spell, the status bonus it grants increases to +10 to that movement speed. In addition, the Morph trait granted by that feat is included as part of Evolved Mobility.</p>"
